{
  "id": "1096",
  "title": "Surgery",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-11-21",
  "synopsis": "Ben must return to his home country for something very important.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1096/40bbe94fdd2e6348ec876cf57fce1b9c6ee916c2.mp3?1596884395",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "手术\n\n本：老师，我下个星期不能来上课，我要回国办手术。\n老师：手术？你怎么了？生病了吗？\n本：不是啊，我要回去工作了，手术很多。\n老师：你说的是“手续”吧！",
    "traditional": "手術\n\n本：老師，我下個星期不能來上課，我要回國辦手術。\n老師：手術？你怎麼了？生病了嗎？\n本：不是啊，我要回去工作了，手術很多。\n老師：你說的是“手續”吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Surgery"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：老师，我下个星期不能来上课，我要回国办手术。",
      "traditional": "本：老師，我下個星期不能來上課，我要回國辦手術。",
      "pinyin": "běn lǎo shī wǒ xià ge xīng qī bù néng lái shàng kè wǒ yào huí guó bàn shǒu shù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Teacher, next week I am unable to come to class. I must return to my home country for surgery."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老师：手术？你怎么了？生病了吗？",
      "traditional": "老師：手術？你怎麼了？生病了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī shǒu shù nǐ zěn me le shēng bìng le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: Surgery? What happened to you? Have you fallen ill?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：不是啊，我要回去工作了，手术很多。",
      "traditional": "本：不是啊，我要回去工作了，手術很多。",
      "pinyin": "běn bú shì a wǒ yào huí qù gōng zuò le shǒu shù hěn duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: No, I must go back for work, there are very many surgeries to be done."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老师：你说的是“手续”吧！",
      "traditional": "老師：你說的是“手續”吧！",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī nǐ shuō de shì shǒu xù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: You are talking about ”procedures”!"
    }
  ],
